Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 18:16:34 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1433/1463] HERESY 1498-1499: the steps on a road of stops,
 other solvers from a take's own codes, the wave's ear, the probes' guard
 counting KV sets; the DAW over the whole window, F11 the studio's
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

1498: Denoising steps a slider of nine stops (8 16 24 32 48 64 96 128 160, 32 by default, the road amber, green, amber, red, Viktor's ear on Heun in its tip); the solvers' names short, their calls a step in the selector's tip; Also render with: each take of a run rendered again by the solvers ticked, from its own codes and sound seed, titled «· Heun 64»; the wave's ear in the player (off: no Whisper, nothing drawn over the wave); fitBatchFor counts the engine's KV sets (3 with the lyrics' own CFG, generate.h), the context's share and a merge as its quant (two probes on IRA-BF16 asked 16.1 GB of KV, OOM 16.10). 1499: the Refiner's DAW over the whole window (moved to the body while so, the window full screen when the browser lets it), its lanes sharing the screen's height, whole waves; F11 on the studio's tab caught (the DAW in sight, else the studio full screen); Esc, F11 or the button back. Kitchen 875/875.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
